42
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:50,710
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Hot-blooded Dropout!</font>

43
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:50,710
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Finally
Unleashed,</font>

44
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:50,710
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the Forbidden
Master Move!</font>

45
00:01:51,670 --> 00:01:52,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did that...?!</font>

46
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not possible!</font>

47
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:57,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While you had your eyes closed
and were praying.</font>

48
00:01:57,380 --> 00:01:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

49
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:02,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a moment, Lee stopped moving
because of the pain in his body.</font>

50
00:02:04,310 --> 00:02:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that moment... that's when!</font>

51
00:02:15,530 --> 00:02:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara!</font>

52
00:02:33,090 --> 00:02:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...!</font>

53
00:02:34,210 --> 00:02:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no doubt about it – his eyes...</font>

54
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:39,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's completely awake...</font>

55
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:43,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The demon... inside him.</font>

56
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:07,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run away!</font>

57
00:03:20,170 --> 00:03:22,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Bowl-Cut's totally worn down...</font>

58
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara is toying with him.</font>

59
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why doesn't Lee-san dodge?</font>

60
00:03:32,230 --> 00:03:36,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Lee-san's speed, he should easily be
able to dodge that level of attack.</font>

61
00:03:37,650 --> 00:03:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that he doesn't dodge,
it's that he can't dodge.</font>

62
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

63
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

64
00:03:43,950 --> 00:03:47,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Lotus is a double-edged sword.</font>

65
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean double-edged sword?</font>

66
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:53,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you think the Lotus is
a forbidden technique?</font>

67
00:03:54,420 --> 00:03:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

68
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:59,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Lotus isn't a Ninjutsu or a Genjutsu.</font>

69
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:02,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a Taijutsu, with that much
high-speed movement.</font>

70
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:06,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The load it puts on a person's body
is beyond imagination.</font>

71
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:09,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Lee's entire body is in
so much pain right now</font>

72
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:10,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that even moving is out of the question.</font>

73
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that so...</font>

74
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy?</font>

75
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:16,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's...!</font>

76
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has no Ninjutsu, not even
one Genjutsu...</font>

77
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, the Taijutsu he depends on,</font>

78
00:04:51,270 --> 00:04:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's now even less than
an average person's...</font>

79
00:04:52,770 --> 00:04:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way he can win!</font>

80
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's had it if this goes on...</font>

81
00:05:01,570 --> 00:05:02,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

82
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, get a move on all of you.</font>

83
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll add another 200 laps!</font>

84
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:19,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid! There's no way
you'll become a Ninja.</font>

85
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I will.</font>

86
00:05:22,050 --> 00:05:26,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way a chump who can't
even use Ninjutsu can become a Ninja!</font>

87
00:05:26,130 --> 00:05:26,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I will!</font>

88
00:05:26,970 --> 00:05:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever, but the fact that a guy like
you without Ninjutsu or Genjutsu</font>

89
00:05:29,850 --> 00:05:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and with less Taijutsu than
an average person</font>

90
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:35,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is in this Ninja academy is nonsense.</font>

91
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:38,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know what you're called here?</font>

92
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:40,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hot-Blooded!</font>

93
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hot-Blooded!</font>

94
00:05:42,530 --> 00:05:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hot-Blooded lose-</font>

95
00:05:44,990 --> 00:05:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, get in line, Lee!</font>

96
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:48,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Lee!</font>

97
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:53,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's the hot-blooded loser
everyone's talking about.</font>

98
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:56,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't he look like
someone we know?</font>

99
00:05:56,580 --> 00:05:57,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

100
00:05:57,870 --> 00:05:59,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In particular... his eyebrows.</font>

101
00:06:00,380 --> 00:06:01,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...</font>

102
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:03,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rock Lee...</font>

103
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The chump who can only perform
less than average Taijutsu...</font>

104
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you...</font>

105
00:06:15,810 --> 00:06:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You practiced your less
than average Taijutsu...</font>

106
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:20,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You practiced it over and
over again like crazy...</font>

107
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">396... 397... 398... 399...</font>

108
00:06:26,110 --> 00:06:29,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">400... 401... 402... 403...</font>

109
00:06:30,530 --> 00:06:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't do a log kick 500 times,
then it's 1,000 squats!</font>

110
00:06:35,410 --> 00:06:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">413... 414...</font>

111
00:06:38,250 --> 00:06:43,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">415... 416... 417... 418...!</font>

112
00:06:44,340 --> 00:06:46,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">419... 420...</font>

113
00:06:46,590 --> 00:06:47,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So someone's here before me...</font>

114
00:06:48,260 --> 00:06:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">422... 423... 424...</font>

115
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:55,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">425... 426...</font>

116
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I suppose I'll come back...</font>

117
00:07:03,110 --> 00:07:07,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't do 1,000 squats,
then it's 2,000 punches!</font>

118
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">795... 796... 797... 798...</font>

119
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's still at it...!</font>

120
00:07:22,670 --> 00:07:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">2,000 punches!</font>

121
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:27,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't, it's 2,000 jump ropes!</font>

122
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:41,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You recklessly practiced only
Taijutsu and eventually...</font>

123
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, you've all become
Genin as of today,</font>

124
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:50,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I'd like to know what
it is you're all aiming for!</font>

125
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, yes, yes, yes!</font>

126
00:07:53,530 --> 00:07:54,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten.</font>

127
00:07:55,120 --> 00:08:00,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to become a powerful Ninja
like the legendary Kunoichi, Tsunade-sama!</font>

128
00:08:01,410 --> 00:08:02,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...</font>

129
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, how about you, Neji?</font>

130
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to answer...</font>

131
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:10,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...!</font>

132
00:08:11,470 --> 00:08:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to prove that I could
become a respectable Ninja</font>

133
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though I can't use
Ninjutsu or Genjutsu!</font>

134
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:20,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would be the ultimate for me!</font>

135
00:08:21,390 --> 00:08:22,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are good serious eyes...</font>

136
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:25,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Humph!
— You!</font>

137
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:26,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's so funny?!</font>

138
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm serious!</font>

139
00:08:27,820 --> 00:08:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will become a respectable Ninja
even only with Taijutsu!</font>

140
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He should give up already...</font>

141
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:38,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate...</font>

142
00:08:38,530 --> 00:08:41,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He will simply die with Gaara
just toying with him...</font>

143
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:44,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brows...!</font>

144
00:08:47,330 --> 00:08:48,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

145
00:09:07,730 --> 00:09:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet... Not yet!</font>

146
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, you just won't learn
your lesson, will you?</font>

147
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you can win...</font>

148
00:09:16,070 --> 00:09:19,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike you, Neji is a genius.</font>

149
00:09:20,910 --> 00:09:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A genius...?</font>

150
00:09:21,990 --> 00:09:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is a genius?!</font>

151
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:27,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though I may not have talent,
I'll exceed genius with my efforts.</font>

152
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is my entire being!</font>

153
00:09:30,460 --> 00:09:32,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is my Ninja Way!</font>

154
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll get nowhere, Lee...</font>

155
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how much effort you make,</font>

156
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no way you can take me down.</font>

157
00:09:40,890 --> 00:09:42,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's simply a fact.</font>

158
00:09:43,020 --> 00:09:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true!</font>

159
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not...</font>

160
00:09:57,910 --> 00:10:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you... refused to give up, not ever!</font>

161
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such meaningless actions...</font>

162
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:41,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Bowl-Cut was unlucky to
have Gaara as his opponent!</font>

163
00:10:41,570 --> 00:10:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

164
00:10:42,660 --> 00:10:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee's not one to give up
with this much.</font>

165
00:10:46,250 --> 00:10:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— Huh?</font>

166
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:49,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason is that Lee...</font>

167
00:10:58,510 --> 00:10:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason is that Lee...</font>

168
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:03,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... continued to make effort.</font>

169
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:09,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't jump rope 1,200 times,
I'll log kick 2,000 times!</font>

170
00:11:10,230 --> 00:11:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">1,116... 1,117...!</font>

171
00:11:12,770 --> 00:11:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">1,118... 1,11...!</font>

172
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:15,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

173
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:32,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee!</font>

174
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:34,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you taking a break already?</font>

175
00:11:44,090 --> 00:11:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei...</font>

176
00:11:45,850 --> 00:11:46,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it that you want?</font>

177
00:11:47,850 --> 00:11:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's about my blunder with
the recent assignment,</font>

178
00:11:51,690 --> 00:11:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe I've apologized.</font>

179
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:57,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee... It's true you're different from Neji.</font>

180
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no Ninjutsu or Genjutsu skills,
and you're not a Taijutsu genius either...</font>

181
00:12:04,450 --> 00:12:05,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Lee...</font>

182
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:08,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you have powers
that exceed Neji...</font>

183
00:12:09,250 --> 00:12:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're a genius with hidden potential.</font>

184
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:15,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're trying to make me feel better,
please stop!</font>

185
00:12:15,790 --> 00:12:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot!</font>

186
00:12:17,090 --> 00:12:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not trying to make you feel better
or anything!</font>

187
00:12:19,710 --> 00:12:21,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason is that you are...</font>

188
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a genius of effort!</font>

189
00:12:31,140 --> 00:12:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if...</font>

190
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's true...?</font>

191
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've... I've believed that to be true...</font>

192
00:12:41,610 --> 00:12:45,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That if I trained harder than Neji...
2 or 3 times as much...</font>

193
00:12:45,780 --> 00:12:47,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that I'd surely become stronger.</font>

194
00:12:48,740 --> 00:12:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

195
00:12:50,700 --> 00:12:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've recently begun to think that...</font>

196
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't beat a real genius.</font>

197
00:12:58,250 --> 00:13:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is effort really rewarded...?</font>

198
00:13:02,130 --> 00:13:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've wanted to know this and</font>

199
00:13:03,050 --> 00:13:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I've taken on Neji,
but it's always been the same...!</font>

200
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm no match for him at all!</font>

201
00:13:10,390 --> 00:13:11,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even when I'm on a mission...</font>

202
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:14,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My legs still tremble even now...</font>

203
00:13:16,020 --> 00:13:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think that I'll never become
stronger though I strive and strive...</font>

204
00:13:21,780 --> 00:13:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am so afraid that I can't bear it!</font>

205
00:13:27,530 --> 00:13:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What am I to do...?</font>

206
00:13:30,870 --> 00:13:35,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point in making the effort
if you don't believe in yourself!</font>

207
00:13:40,710 --> 00:13:44,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, you're very similar to me.</font>

208
00:13:44,340 --> 00:13:45,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you mean our eyebrows?</font>

209
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, not just our eyebrows...</font>

210
00:13:48,930 --> 00:13:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was actually a failure once too...</font>

211
00:13:52,850 --> 00:13:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were, Sensei?</font>

212
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:58,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now, I can even win against
the genius elite Kakashi,</font>

213
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:01,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because of my efforts...</font>

214
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I'd like to prove that I can become
a respectable Ninja</font>

215
00:14:05,190 --> 00:14:08,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though I can't use Ninjutsu
and Genjutsu" you said.</font>

216
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:11,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's your Ninja Way, right?</font>

217
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a fine goal...</font>

218
00:14:14,410 --> 00:14:17,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a fine goal worth sticking to!</font>

219
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:25,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why you should believe in
your path and forge straight ahead!</font>

220
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Become a man powerful enough
so that I can just watch you smiling!</font>

221
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understand, Lee?!</font>

222
00:14:34,770 --> 00:14:35,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

223
00:14:51,950 --> 00:14:55,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you... Guy-sensei...!</font>

224
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Lee-san!</font>

225
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:07,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you fight any more, you'll die!</font>

226
00:15:09,430 --> 00:15:10,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brows...</font>

227
00:15:18,890 --> 00:15:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

228
00:15:19,770 --> 00:15:20,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Movement has...</font>

229
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:22,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...returned to Lee!</font>

230
00:15:25,070 --> 00:15:27,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei is smiling and watching me...</font>

231
00:15:28,490 --> 00:15:31,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And just because of that,
I can come back stronger!</font>

232
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stronger... stronger still!</font>

233
00:15:36,620 --> 00:15:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san's smiling... even though
he's been driven into a corner.</font>

234
00:15:40,830 --> 00:15:41,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

235
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:44,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's his turn to do the driving.</font>

236
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:45,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

237
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf's Lotus blossoms twice.</font>

238
00:15:49,590 --> 00:15:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blossoms twice...?</font>

239
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:54,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san said that too!</font>

240
00:15:56,890 --> 00:15:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf's Lotus blossoms twice.</font>

241
00:15:59,890 --> 00:16:05,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we meet the next time,
I vow that I will be an even stronger man.</font>

242
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, Guy!
You haven't?!</font>

243
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:11,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's exactly as you imagine.</font>

244
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that Genin...</font>

245
00:16:14,450 --> 00:16:18,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that boy can open the Eight Inner Gates
in his body and use the Hidden Lotus...</font>

246
00:16:18,950 --> 00:16:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hidden Lotus?</font>

247
00:16:21,620 --> 00:16:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

248
00:16:23,670 --> 00:16:24,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is incredible...</font>

249
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:28,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy...</font>

250
00:16:29,170 --> 00:16:33,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How many of the Eight Inner Gates
can that boy open now...?</font>

251
00:16:34,970 --> 00:16:35,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five gates.</font>

252
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What exactly is it?</font>

253
00:16:37,930 --> 00:16:41,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These Eight Inner Gates and
that Hidden Lotus?</font>

254
00:16:41,850 --> 00:16:43,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Eight Inner Gates are
"Limiter Releases"</font>

255
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:49,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">used in preparations for
reaching the Hidden Lotus.</font>

256
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:51,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A "Limiter Releases"?</font>

257
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

258
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the Chakra Network
where chakra flows,</font>

259
00:16:58,240 --> 00:17:00,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there are eight places where the
chakra points are concentrated</font>

260
00:17:00,540 --> 00:17:02,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in each area of the body from the
head area down...</font>

261
00:17:00,930 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="YaFont"><font color="#ececec"><b>Opening</b></font></font></b></font>

262
00:17:01,930 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="YaFont"><font color="#ececec"><b>Rest</b></font></font></b></font>

263
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:06,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Gate of Opening, Gate of Rest,
Gate of Life, Gate of Pain,</font>

264
00:17:02,930 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="YaFont"><font color="#ececec"><b>Life</b></font></font></b></font>

265
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="YaFont"><font color="#ececec"><b>Pain</b></font></font></b></font>

266
00:17:04,940 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="YaFont"><font color="#ececec"><b>Closing</b></font></font></b></font>

267
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="YaFont"><font color="#ececec"><b>Joy</b></font></font></b></font>

268
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:11,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gate of Closing, Gate of Joy,
Gate of Shock and Gate of Death.</font>

269
00:17:06,940 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="YaFont"><font color="#ececec"><b>Shock</b></font></font></b></font>

270
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="YaFont"><font color="#ececec"><b>Death</b></font></font></b></font>

271
00:17:13,050 --> 00:17:14,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are called the Eight Inner Gates.</font>

272
00:17:16,430 --> 00:17:17,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These eight gates
continually "limit"</font>

273
00:17:18,100 --> 00:17:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the amount of Chakra flowing
through the body...</font>

274
00:17:22,980 --> 00:17:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, the Lotus's essence is to force
the boundaries of these "limits" to open...</font>

275
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:33,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and bring out several
tens of times the body's strength.</font>

276
00:17:35,450 --> 00:17:36,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Primary Lotus...</font>

277
00:17:36,990 --> 00:17:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">opens only the first gate,
the Gate of Opening,</font>

278
00:17:40,660 --> 00:17:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and releases the brains restraints</font>

279
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:46,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to bring forth a person's muscles' strength
to its fullest!</font>

280
00:17:46,750 --> 00:17:48,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the kind of technique it is.</font>

281
00:17:52,460 --> 00:17:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... what is the Hidden Lotus?</font>

282
00:17:55,590 --> 00:18:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After forcing the stamina to increase
at the second gate, the Gate of Rest...</font>

283
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:04,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the third gate, the Gate of Life,
one enters the Hidden Lotus!</font>

284
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

285
00:18:05,850 --> 00:18:09,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even after using just the Primary Lotus,
his body was in shambles.</font>

286
00:18:09,860 --> 00:18:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So if he uses a technique beyond that...</font>

287
00:18:12,190 --> 00:18:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

288
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

289
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:16,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By opening all the 8 gates,</font>

290
00:18:17,030 --> 00:18:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one attains strength exceeding
even the Hokage, but in return...</font>

291
00:18:23,950 --> 00:18:24,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one dies!</font>

292
00:18:27,040 --> 00:18:30,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't intend to pry into what that
boy means to you</font>

293
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or to tell you not to bring
your personal feelings into play...</font>

294
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there is a limit!</font>

295
00:18:35,670 --> 00:18:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've misjudged you... Guy!</font>

296
00:18:39,130 --> 00:18:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you know... about that boy?!</font>

